<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo grows 32pct in April.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo grows 32pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total air cargo flown to and</p>
<p>from Munich airport (MUC) in April grew 32.2 percent to 8,091</p>
<p>tonnes, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>The following tables show cargo handled at Munich airport in</p>
<p>March and for the year to date in tonnes and with year-on-year</p>
<p>percentage changes.</p>
<p>		     April Pct change  Jan-Apr  Pct change</p>
<p>    Exports	3,892  Up 48.4    14,649   Up 31.0</p>
<p>    Imports	3,625  Up 19.1    13,913   Up 14.2</p>
<p>    Transit	  574  Up 26.7     2,702   Up 22.5</p>
<p>    Total cargo  8,091  Up 32.2    31,264   Up 22.2</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH market research dept. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
</text>
